Sreang air: ['html'] dèan: { <- (
		fhèin
		cuir-an-àite: ['&'] le: ['&amp;'],
		cuir-an-àite: ['<'] le: ['&lt;'],
		cuir-an-àite: ['>'] le: ['&gt;'],
		cuir-an-àite: ['"'] le: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Liosta ùr.

['Verbatim Syntax'] caractaran gach: { :àireamh :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (àireamh), Letter: letter).
}.

Às-chur list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list ceangail: ['↵']).

Às-chur sgrìobh: template.

